		"description": {
			"value": "<p>Were-boars</p><hr><p><strong>While in your Animal or Hybrid form:</strong></p><p>You have a tusk attack that deals @Damage[1d8[slashing]] damage with the shove trait and in the brawling weapon group.</p><p>You can speak with other boar and pig creatures.</p><p>Your land speed is 25 ft.</p><p></p><p><strong>While in your Animal form:</strong></p><p>Your equipment melds into your new form. You use your unarmored defense modifier for your AC. Your weapons are not available. Magic items that have a passive effect no longer work and magic items are not able to be activated except items that are specifically made for animal forms (such as @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Dntj7zwUTmj4fboD]).</p><p>You are unable to cast spells or any actions that specifically need somatic requirements, like hand movements.</p><p>You are unable to speak, except to other animals of your type.</p>",
